--     * Slot: shareForOther Description: Shall occur if a Merger Event occurs and the consideration for the relevant Security consists solely of Other Consideration.
--     * Slot: shareForCombined Description: Shall occur if a Merger Event occurs and the consideration for the relevant Security consists solely of Combined Consideration.
