--     * Slot: BusinessCenters_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: commodityBusinessCalendar
-- # Class: CalculationFrequency_businessCenter
--     * Slot: CalculationFrequency_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: businessCenter Description: Specifies the business center for adjustment of calculation period.
