--     * Slot: date
-- # Class: DateTimeList_dateTime
--     * Slot: DateTimeList_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: dateTime Description: The CDM specifies that the zoned date time is to be expressed in accordance with ISO 8601, either as UTC as an offset to UTC.
-- # Class: Measure_datedValue
--     * Slot: Measure_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs must be absent.
-- # Class: MeasureBase_datedValue
--     * Slot: MeasureBase_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs. On each step date the associated step value becomes effective. A list of steps may be ordered in the document by ascending step date. An FpML document containing an unordered list of steps is still regarded as a conformant document.
-- # Class: NonNegativeMeasure_datedValue
--     * Slot: NonNegativeMeasure_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs must be absent.
-- # Class: NonNegativeQuantity_datedValue
--     * Slot: NonNegativeQuantity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule must be absent.
-- # Class: NonNegativeQuantitySchedule_datedValue
--     * Slot: NonNegativeQuantitySchedule_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: For a non-negative quantity schedule, all amount attribute must be positive.
-- # Class: NonNegativeSchedule_datedValue
--     * Slot: NonNegativeSchedule_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and non-negative value pairs. On each step date the associated step value becomes effective. A list of steps may be ordered in the document by ascending step date. An FpML document containing an unordered list of steps is still regarded as a conformant document.
-- # Class: Quantity_datedValue
--     * Slot: Quantity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule must be absent.
-- # Class: QuantitySchedule_datedValue
--     * Slot: QuantitySchedule_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs. On each step date the associated step value becomes effective. A list of steps may be ordered in the document by ascending step date. An FpML document containing an unordered list of steps is still regarded as a conformant document.
-- # Class: Schedule_datedValue
--     * Slot: Schedule_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs. On each step date the associated step value becomes effective. A list of steps may be ordered in the document by ascending step date. An FpML document containing an unordered list of steps is still regarded as a conformant document.
-- # Class: ScheduleWithInitialValue_datedValue
--     * Slot: ScheduleWithInitialValue_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: datedValue_id Description: The schedule of step date and value pairs. On each step date the associated step value becomes effective. A list of steps may be ordered in the document by ascending step date. An FpML document containing an unordered list of steps is still regarded as a conformant document.
