--     * Slot: priceQuantity_id Description: Defines the prices (e.g. spread, equity price, FX rate), quantities (e.g. currency amount, no. shares) and settlement terms (e.g. initial fee, broker fee, up-front cds payment or option premium settlement) associated with the constituents of the transacted product.
