-- # Class: Lineage_portfolioStateReference
--     * Slot: Lineage_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: portfolioStateReference_id Description: The reference to the previous state of a Portfolio, in a chain of Events leading up to a build of that Portfolio as the holding of Product(s) in specific Quantity(ies). As part of the PortfolioState object, a pointer to the previous PortfolioState is provided through a Lineage object, together with pointer(s) to the Event or set of Events leading up to the current (new) state.
