-- # Class: FloatingRateDefinition_capRate
--     * Slot: FloatingRateDefinition_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: capRate_id Description: The cap rate, if any, which applies to the floating rate for the calculation period. The cap rate (strike) is only required where the floating rate on a swap stream is capped at a certain strike level. The cap rate is assumed to be exclusive of any spread and is a per annum rate, expressed as a decimal. A cap rate of 5% would be represented as 0.05.
-- # Class: FloatingRateDefinition_floorRate
--     * Slot: FloatingRateDefinition_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: floorRate_id Description: The floor rate, if any, which applies to the floating rate for the calculation period. The floor rate (strike) is only required where the floating rate on a swap stream is floored at a certain strike level. The floor rate is assumed to be exclusive of any spread and is a per annum rate, expressed as a decimal. The floor rate of 5% would be represented as 0.05.
-- # Class: GeneralTerms_additionalTerm
