-- # Class: ResolvablePriceQuantity_priceSchedule
--     * Slot: ResolvablePriceQuantity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: priceSchedule_id Description: A payout's price specified as a schedule, which may also contain a single value if that price is constant. There may be multiple prices specified for a single payout: e.g. a floating interest rate leg may specify a spread, a cap and/or floor and a multiplier. The price must be specified outside of the payout in a PriceQuantity object and only referenced inside the payout using an address.
-- # Class: SettlementTerms_cashSettlementTerms
